INFO:     127.0.0.1:57806 - "GET /api/feedback?node_id=&msg_id=%5B%22assistant%22%2C%22Meditation%20offers%20a%20multifaceted%20array%20of%20cognitive%2C%20psychological%2C%20and%20physiological%20benefits%20that%20have%20been%20increasingly%20validated%20by%20empirical%20research.%20By%20fostering%20a%20state%20of%20focused%20attention%20and%20non-judgmental%20awareness%2C%20regular%20practice%20can%20significantly%20reduce%20the%20physiological%20markers%20of%20stress%2C%20such%20as%20cortisol%20levels%2C%20while%20simultaneously%20enhancing%20emotional%20regulation%20by%20strengthening%20the%20neural%20pathways%20between%20the%20prefrontal%20cortex%20and%20the%20amygdala.%20This%20improved%20connectivity%20allows%20individuals%20to%20respond%20to%20stressors%20with%20greater%20equanimity%20rather%20than%20reactive%20emotional%20outbursts.%20Furthermore%2C%20consistent%20meditation%20has%20been%20shown%20to%20improve%20executive%20functions%2C%20including%20sustained%20attention%2C%20working%20memory%2C%20and%20cognitive%20flexibility%2C%20which%20are%20essential%20for%20navigating%20complex%20professional%20and%20personal%20environments.%20Beyond%20mental%20acuity%2C%20the%20practice%20promotes%20physical%20well-being%20by%20lowering%20blood%20pressure%2C%20improving%20sleep%20quality%20through%20the%20reduction%20of%20pre-sleep%20rumination%2C%20and%20bolstering%20the%20immune%20system.%20As%20one%20develops%20deeper%20self-awareness%20and%20meta-cognition%20through%20mindfulness%2C%20the%20capacity%20for%20empathetic%20engagement%20and%20prosocial%20behavior%20often%20increases%2C%20leading%20to%20more%20resilient%20interpersonal%20relationships%20and%20a%20more%20stable%20sense%20of%20subjective%20well-being.%20Publication%20date%3A%2004%20November%202026.%22%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%5D&session_id=ct-246eb4e5 HTTP/1.1" 200 OK
