INFO:     127.0.0.1:57806 - "GET /api/feedback?node_id=&msg_id=%5B%22assistant%22%2C%22Based%20on%20the%20document%2C%20here%27s%20what%20it%20says%20about%20how%20a%20model%20is%20trained%2C%20with%20direct%20quotes%3A%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%20Pre-training%20Data%20Curation%20and%20Scaling%5Cn%5Cn**Training%20on%20code%20and%20its%20benefits%3A**%5Cn%3E%20%5C%22Training%20on%20code%20forces%20models%20to%20track%20variable%20scopes%2C%20maintain%20state%20across%20nested%20blocks%2C%20and%20execute%20formal%20logic%2C%20skills%20that%20transfer%20directly%20to%20mathematical%20problem-solving%20and%20general%20text%20generation.%5C%22%20%5B%5Bp%3A16%7Cskills%20that%20transfer%20directly%20to%20mathematical%5D%5D%5Cn%5Cn**Chinchilla%20Scaling%20Laws%3A**%5Cn%3E%20%5C%22The%20foundational%20Chinchilla%20study%20by%20Hoffmann%20et%20al.%20(2022)%20demonstrated%20that%20compute-optimal%20training%20requires%20scaling%20parameters%20and%20tokens%20roughly%20equally%2C%20targeting%20approximately%2020%20tokens%20per%20parameter.%5C%22%20%5B%5Bp%3A14%7C20%20tokens%20per%20parameter%5D%5D%5Cn%5Cn**Modern%20training%20shifts%3A**%5Cn%3E%20%5C%22Despite%20this%20theoretical%20baseline%2C%20modern%20frontier%20training%20has%20experienced%20a%20decisive%20shift%20from%20compute-optimal%20training%20to%20inference-optimal%20strategies.%20Because%20inference%20costs%20recur%20over%20a%20model%27s%20lifetime%20while%20training%20costs%20are%20incurred%20only%20once%2C%20production%20models%20are%20frequently%20%27overtrained%27%20relative%20to%20the%20Chinchilla%20optimum.%5C%22%20%5B%5Bp%3A14%7Cinference-optimal%20strategies%5D%5D%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%20Distributed%20Training%20Infrastructure%5Cn%5Cn**Parallelism%20strategies%3A**%5Cn%3E%20%5C%22Modern%20scaling%20paradigms%20have%20pushed%20beyond%20dense%20Transformer%20designs%20toward%20Mixture-of-Experts%20(MoE)%20architectures%2C%20which%20decouple%20total%20model%20parameter%20capacity%20from%20active%20computation%20cost%20per%20token.%5C%22%20%5B%5Bp%3A5%7CMixture-of-Experts%20architectures%5D%5D%5Cn%5Cn%3E%20%5C%22Token-level%20gating%20versus%20Expert-level%20choice%20routing%20algorithms%20to%20balance%20load%20and%20prevent%20expert%20collapse.%5C%22%20%5B%5Bp%3A6%7CExpert-level%20choice%20routing%5D%5D%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%20Post-Training%20Alignment%5Cn%5Cn**Alignment%20pipeline%3A**%5Cn%3E%20%5C%22Pretrained%20foundation%20models%20require%20rigorous%20post-training%20alignment%20to%20adhere%20to%20human%20intentions%2C%20safety%20guidelines%2C%20and%20task%20instructions.%20The%20alignment%20pipeline%20progresses%20from%20Supervised%20Fine-Tuning%20(SFT)%20on%20curated%20instruction%20datasets%20to%20advanced%20preference%20optimization%20frameworks.%5C%22%20%5B%5Bp%3A7%7Calignment%20pipeline%20progresses%5D%5D%5Cn%5Cn%3E%20%5C%22Supervised%20Fine-Tuning%20(SFT)%2C%20Reinforcement%20Learning%20from%20Human%20Feedback%20(RLHF)%2C%20and%20Direct%20Preference%20Optimization%20(DPO).%5C%22%20%5B%5Bp%3A7%7CSupervised%20Fine-Tuning%20(SFT)%5D%5Cn%5CnThe%20document%20emphasizes%20that%20model%20training%20involves%20three%20main%20phases%3A%20pre-training%20with%20massive%20datasets%20following%20scaling%20laws%2C%20distributed%20training%20using%20parallelism%20and%20MoE%20architectures%2C%20and%20post-training%20alignment%20to%20ensure%20models%20follow%20human%20preferences%20and%20safety%20guidelines.%22%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%5D&session_id=ct-781aa4af HTTP/1.1" 200 OK
