bde3c HTTP/1.1" 200 OK
INFO:     127.0.0.1:55103 - "GET /api/feedback?node_id=&msg_id=%5B%22assistant%22%2C%22In%20**Document.pdf**%2C%20the%20attention%20mechanism%20is%20explained%20in%20Section%201.1%20(*Scaled%20Dot-Product%20Attention%20and%20Multi-Head%20Projections*)%20%5B%5Bp%3A4%7C1.1%20Scaled%20Dot-Product%20Attention%20and%5D%5D.%20%5Cn%5CnThe%20document%20describes%20how%20the%20encoder%20and%20decoder%20stacks%20are%20composed%20of%20layers%20containing%20multi-head%20self-attention%20mechanisms%20and%20fully%20connected%20feed-forward%20networks%20%5B%5Bp%3A%7CThe%20encoder%20is%20composed%20of%20a%20stack%20of%20six%20identical%20layers%5D%5D.%20It%20details%20the%20core%20mathematical%20engine%20of%20the%20Transformer%20as%20the%20self-attention%20mechanism%2C%20which%20maps%20queries%20and%20key-value%20pairs%20to%20an%20output%20computed%20as%20a%20weighted%20sum%20of%20the%20values%20%5B%5Bp%3A%7CThe%20core%20mathematical%20engine%20of%20the%20Transformer%20is%20the%20self-attention%20mechanism%5D%5D.%20%5Cn%5CnSpecifically%2C%20the%20document%20defines%20**Scaled%20Dot-Product%20Attention**%20with%20the%20formula%3A%5Cn%24%24%5C%5Ctext%7BAttention%7D(Q%2C%20K%2C%20V)%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsoftmax%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7BQK%5ET%7D%7B%5C%5Csqrt%7Bd_k%7D%7D%5C%5Cright)V%24%24%5Cnwhere%20the%20dot%20products%20of%20the%20query%20with%20all%20keys%20are%20divided%20by%20the%20square%20root%20of%20%24d_k%24%20before%20passing%20through%20a%20softmax%20function%20to%20determine%20the%20weights%20assigned%20to%20the%20values%20%5B%5Bp%3A%7CSpecifically%2C%20the%20architecture%20implements%20Scaled%20Dot-Product%20Attention%2C%20where%20the%20input%20consists%20of%20queries%20and%20keys%20of%20dimension%20dk%20and%20values%20of%20dimension%20dv%5D%5D.%20%5Cn%5CnIt%20also%20explains%20**Multi-Head%20Attention**%2C%20which%20extends%20this%20formulation%20by%20linearly%20projecting%20queries%2C%20keys%2C%20and%20values%20into%20different%20representation%20subspaces%2C%20allowing%20the%20model%20to%20jointly%20attend%20to%20information%20from%20multiple%20positions%20and%20subspaces%20in%20parallel%20%5B%5Bp%3A%7CMulti-head%20attention%20extends%20this%20single%20formulation%20by%20allowing%20the%20model%20to%20jointly%20attend%20to%20information%20from%20different%20representation%20subspaces%5D%5D.%22%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%5D&session_id=ct-879bde3c HTTP/1.1" 200 OK
