INFO:     127.0.0.1:50709 - "GET /api/feedback?node_id=&msg_id=%5B%22assistant%22%2C%22The%20weather%20forecast%20for%20Chennai%20on%20Friday%2C%20November%206%2C%202026%2C%20indicates%20unsettled%20conditions%20with%20a%20high%20likelihood%20of%20precipitation.%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%23%20Temperature%20and%20Conditions%5Cn-%20**Temperature%3A**%20The%20maximum%20temperature%20is%20expected%20to%20be%2031.1%C2%B0C%20(Times%20of%20India)%20or%2031%C2%B0C%20(meteoblue)%2C%20with%20a%20minimum%20of%2024.3%C2%B0C%20(Times%20of%20India).%20Hourly%20temperature%20projections%20from%20meteoblue%20range%20between%2026%C2%B0C%20and%2030%C2%B0C.%5Cn-%20**Conditions%3A**%20Patchy%20rain%20is%20expected%20(Times%20of%20India)%2C%20with%20meteoblue%20forecasting%20a%20chance%20of%20thunderstorms%20and%20local%20showers.%20The%20sun%20is%20not%20expected%20to%20be%20visible%20throughout%20the%20day%20according%20to%20meteoblue.%5Cn-%20**Sunlight%3A**%20Sunrise%20is%20at%2006%3A04%20AM%20and%20sunset%20is%20at%2005%3A41%20PM%20(Times%20of%20India).%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%23%20Precipitation%20and%20Wind%5Cn-%20**Rain%20Probability%3A**%20There%20is%20a%2071%25%20probability%20of%20rain%20(Times%20of%20India)%20to%20approximately%2090%25%20(meteoblue).%5Cn-%20**Precipitation%20Levels%3A**%20Hourly%20precipitation%20is%20forecasted%20by%20meteoblue%20to%20range%20from%200%20mm%20to%203%20mm%20throughout%20the%20day.%5Cn-%20**Wind%3A**%20A%20light%20breeze%20of%207%20to%2012%20km%2Fh%20is%20expected%20overnight%2C%20increasing%20to%20a%20gentle%20breeze%20of%2012%20to%2020%20km%2Fh%20during%20the%20day.%20The%20wind%20direction%20will%20shift%20from%20North%20during%20the%20night%20and%20morning%20to%20Northeast%20in%20the%20afternoon%20(meteoblue).%5Cn-%20**Atmospheric%20Pressure%3A**%201013%20hPa%20(meteoblue).%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%23%20Humidity%20and%20UV%20Index%5Cn-%20**Humidity%3A**%20Hourly%20humidity%20levels%20are%20forecasted%20to%20fluctuate%20between%2045%25%20and%2070%25%20(meteoblue).%5Cn-%20**UV%20Index%3A**%20The%20UV%20index%20is%20expected%20to%20reach%209.2%20(Times%20of%20India)%20or%20up%20to%207%20(meteoblue).%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%23%20Where%20sources%20disagree%5Cn-%20**Rain%20Probability%3A**%20The%20Times%20of%20India%20reports%20a%2071%25%20probability%20of%20rain%2C%20while%20meteoblue%20forecasts%20a%20higher%20probability%20near%2090%25.%5Cn-%20**UV%20Index%3A**%20The%20Times%20of%20India%20reports%20a%20UV%20index%20of%209.2%2C%20whereas%20meteoblue%20estimates%20a%20lower%20index%20of%20up%20to%207.%5Cn%5Cn%23%23%23%20Caveats%5Cn-%20Weather%20forecasts%20are%20predictions%20and%20can%20vary%3B%20both%20sources%20advise%20that%20deviations%20are%20expected%20and%20suggest%20checking%20for%20the%20latest%20updates.%20Additionally%2C%20the%20source%20world-weather.info%20was%20unreachable%20(404%20error).%5Cn%5CnSources%3A%5Cn-%20%5BChennai%20Weather%20Tomorrow%206%20November%202026%5D(https%3A%2F%2Ftimesofindia.indiatimes.com%2Fweather%2Ftomorrow%2Fchennai-weather-forecast-tomorrow%2F3246)%5Cn-%20%5BWeather%20Chennai%20Tomorrow%20-%20meteoblue%5D(https%3A%2F%2Fwww.meteoblue.com%2Fen%2Fweather%2Fweek%2Fchennai_india_1264527%3Fday%3D2)%22%2Cnull%2Cnull%2Cfalse%2Cnull%5D&session_id=c-c82e3517 HTTP/1.1" 200 OK
